{"status": "success", "document": {"json_content": {"texts": [{"self_ref": "#/texts/2", "label": "text", "text": "六年级 下册", "level": null, "prov": [{"page_no": 1}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/3", "label": "section_header", "text": "上海教育出版社", "level": 6, "prov": [{"page_no": 1}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/4", "label": "section_header", "text": "义务教育教科书", "level": 6, "prov": [{"page_no": 1}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/5", "label": "text", "text": "（五·四学制）", "level": null, "prov": [{"page_no": 1}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/6", "label": "text", "text": "ENGLISH", "level": null, "prov": [{"page_no": 1}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/7", "label": "section_header", "text": "英语", "level": 1, "prov": [{"page_no": 1}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/8", "label": "text", "text": "上海教育出版社", "level": null, "prov": [{"page_no": 1}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/9", "label": "text", "text": "上海教育出版社", "level": null, "prov": [{"page_no": 1}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/10", "label": "section_header", "text": "上海教育出版社", "level": 6, "prov": [{"page_no": 2}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/11", "label": "section_header", "text": "上海教育出版社", "level": 6, "prov": [{"page_no": 2}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/12", "label": "section_header", "text": "上海教育出版社", "level": 6, "prov": [{"page_no": 3}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/13", "label": "section_header", "text": "义务教育教科书", "level": 6, "prov": [{"page_no": 3}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/14", "label": "text", "text": "（五·四学制）", "level": null, "prov": [{"page_no": 3}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/15", "label": "section_header", "text": "英语", "level": 2, "prov": [{"page_no": 3}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/16", "label": "text", "text": "六年级 下册", "level": null, "prov": [{"page_no": 3}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/17", "label": "text", "text": "主编 束定芳", "level": null, "prov": [{"page_no": 3}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/18", "label": "text", "text": "上海教育出版社", "level": null, "prov": [{"page_no": 3}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/19", "label": "section_header", "text": "上海教育出版社", "level": 6, "prov": [{"page_no": 3}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/20", "label": "section_header", "text": "上海教育出版社", "level": 6, "prov": [{"page_no": 4}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/30", "label": "text", "text": "本册教材部分图片由图虫·创意、壹图网、视觉中国等图片网站提供", "level": null, "prov": [{"page_no": 4}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/31", "label": "section_header", "text": "义务教育教科书（五·四学制） 英语 六年级下册", "level": 6, "prov": [{"page_no": 4}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/42", "label": "text", "text": "版权所有·未经许可不得采用任何方式擅自复制或使用本产品任何部分·违者必究", "level": null, "prov": [{"page_no": 4}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/43", "label": "text", "text": "如发现内容质量问题，请拨打 021-64319241；", "level": null, "prov": [{"page_no": 4}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/44", "label": "text", "text": "如发现印、装问题，请拨打 021-64373213，我社负责调换。", "level": null, "prov": [{"page_no": 4}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/46", "label": "text", "text": "声明 按照《中华人民共和国著作权法》第二十五条有关规定，我们已尽量寻找著作权人支付稿酬。著 作权人如有关于支付稿酬事宜可及时与出版社联系。", "level": null, "prov": [{"page_no": 4}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/47", "label": "section_header", "text": "上海教育出版社", "level": 6, "prov": [{"page_no": 4}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/48", "label": "text", "text": "亲爱的同学：", "level": null, "prov": [{"page_no": 5}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/49", "label": "text", "text": "欢迎与我们一起继续初中阶段的英语学习！", "level": null, "prov": [{"page_no": 5}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/50", "label": "text", "text": "本学期，你将继续和教材中的小伙伴们一起，在学习英语的同时，探索新世界、思考大问题 （Big Question），在真实情境中\"讲（文化）小故事，悟（人生）大道理，学百科新知识，用英语做 事情\"。我们将通过教材，帮助你运用科学有效的方法学习英语，发展英语语言能力，培育文化意 识，提升思维品质，提高学习能力。", "level": null, "prov": [{"page_no": 5}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/51", "label": "text", "text": "本套教材的每个单元以主题为引领，从大问题入手，设有五个小话题，分别对应听力、口语、 阅读、写作和项目探究五大板块。每个话题下包含符合初中生学习、生活和成长特点的类型丰富 的语篇，设计层层推进的学习活动，帮助你获得丰富的学习体验，并在学习过程中了解自己的学 习成效，最终对单元大问题有更加全面、深入的认识和理解。", "level": null, "prov": [{"page_no": 5}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/52", "label": "text", "text": "围绕不同的主题，教材通过鲜活真实的语言素材，为你提供地道的语言示范。本册教材中， 听力、口语板块的多模态文本图文结合，均以日常生活中常见的真实情境为范本设计 （如节目单、 展板、网页、海报等）；听力板块配有广播、播客、天气预报、歌曲等各类音频素材；在阅读板块， 你可以接触到寓言、故事、网络回帖、新闻、演讲、传记等丰富的语篇类型；教材中小伙伴们的日 常会话和他们的习作，也会为你提供口语和写作表达的范例。", "level": null, "prov": [{"page_no": 5}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/53", "label": "text", "text": "在你学习教材的过程中，智能机器人\"胡博士\"（Dr Hu）将会继续陪伴你左右，帮助你掌握 语言知识、技能和学习策略。每单元最后的\"项目探究\"（Project）为你准备了更多的挑战任 务。你准备好迎接挑战了吗？", "level": null, "prov": [{"page_no": 5}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/54", "label": "text", "text": "本册教材除了常规单元以外，还设有两个文化角（Culture corner）和一个文学角 （Literature corner）。文化角不仅带你更深入地了解中国文化，学会用英语讲中国故事，还带你领略多样的世 界文化。文学角中，我们精选了广受青少年喜爱的优秀文学作品片段，供你赏析。", "level": null, "prov": [{"page_no": 5}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/55", "label": "text", "text": "希望这套教材给你带来学习英语的新体验、新收获，为你插上一双逐梦的翅膀，飞向世界，飞 向未来！", "level": null, "prov": [{"page_no": 5}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/56", "label": "section_header", "text": "上海教育出版社", "level": 6, "prov": [{"page_no": 5}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/57", "label": "section_header", "text": "上海教育出版社", "level": 6, "prov": [{"page_no": 5}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/58", "label": "section_header", "text": "致同学", "level": 6, "prov": [{"page_no": 5}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/59", "label": "section_header", "text": "Contents", "level": 6, "prov": [{"page_no": 6}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/128", "label": "section_header", "text": "上海教育出版社", "level": 6, "prov": [{"page_no": 6}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/129", "label": "section_header", "text": "上海教育出版社", "level": 6, "prov": [{"page_no": 6}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/130", "label": "section_header", "text": "上海教育出版社", "level": 6, "prov": [{"page_no": 7}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/200", "label": "section_header", "text": "上海教育出版社", "level": 6, "prov": [{"page_no": 7}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/201", "label": "section_header", "text": "上海教育出版社", "level": 6, "prov": [{"page_no": 8}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/242", "label": "section_header", "text": "上海教育出版社", "level": 6, "prov": [{"page_no": 8}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/243", "label": "section_header", "text": "上海教育出版社", "level": 6, "prov": [{"page_no": 9}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/244", "label": "section_header", "text": "上海教育出版社", "level": 6, "prov": [{"page_no": 9}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/245", "label": "text", "text": "上海教育出版社", "level": null, "prov": [{"page_no": 10}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/246", "label": "section_header", "text": "Everyone is different 1 Unit", "level": 3, "prov": [{"page_no": 10}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/248", "label": "section_header", "text": "上海教育出版社", "level": 6, "prov": [{"page_no": 10}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/249", "label": "page_footer", "text": "2", "level": null, "prov": [{"page_no": 10}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/250", "label": "section_header", "text": "上海教育出版社", "level": 6, "prov": [{"page_no": 11}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/251", "label": "section_header", "text": "To-do list", "level": 6, "prov": [{"page_no": 11}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/252", "label": "text", "text": "1 \u0007Listen to a poem about the ways people are different. 2 \u0007Talk about my classmates' strong points. 3 \u0007Read a fable about what makes each animal unique. 4 \u0007Write a self-introduction to show a unique self. 5 \u0007Make a profile of \"Future me\".", "level": null, "prov": [{"page_no": 11}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/253", "label": "section_header", "text": "Getting started", "level": 6, "prov": [{"page_no": 11}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/254", "label": "text", "text": "Look at the pictures and list at least three different points between any two students.", "level": null, "prov": [{"page_no": 11}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/255", "label": "section_header", "text": "上海教育出版社", "level": 6, "prov": [{"page_no": 11}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/256", "label": "page_footer", "text": "3", "level": null, "prov": [{"page_no": 11}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/257", "label": "text", "text": "A", "level": null, "prov": [{"page_no": 12}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/258", "label": "section_header", "text": "上海教育出版社", "level": 6, "prov": [{"page_no": 12}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/259", "label": "text", "text": "Noticing differences", "level": null, "prov": [{"page_no": 12}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/260", "label": "text", "text": "4", "level": null, "prov": [{"page_no": 12}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/261", "label": "text", "text": "Ms Chen is sharing with her class a picture of some visiting students from", "level": null, "prov": [{"page_no": 12}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/262", "label": "text", "text": "Swan Lake Middle School, a partner school of New Star in Auckland.", "level": null, "prov": [{"page_no": 12}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/264", "label": "text", "text": "A1 \u0007Look and say Look at the picture. You may use the words or phrases from", "level": null, "prov": [{"page_no": 12}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/265", "label": "text", "text": "the box to talk about the students.", "level": null, "prov": [{"page_no": 12}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/266", "label": "text", "text": "· tall short big small thin slim fat · curly/straight/short/long/dark/brown hair · T-shirt trousers skirt jeans", "level": null, "prov": [{"page_no": 12}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/267", "label": "text", "text": "They will come to our school next week. What do they look like?", "level": null, "prov": [{"page_no": 12}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/268", "label": "text", "text": "The girl in the blue skirt has long brown hair.", "level": null, "prov": [{"page_no": 12}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/269", "label": "text", "text": "She's short and slim.", "level": null, "prov": [{"page_no": 12}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/270", "label": "section_header", "text": "上海教育出版社", "level": 6, "prov": [{"page_no": 12}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/271", "label": "text", "text": "Viewing and listening", "level": null, "prov": [{"page_no": 12}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/272", "label": "section_header", "text": "上海教育出版社", "level": 6, "prov": [{"page_no": 13}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/280", "label": "text", "text": "A3 \u0007Listen and take notes Listen again and complete the table.", "level": null, "prov": [{"page_no": 13}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/281", "label": "section_header", "text": "Letters \"f\", \"ph\" and \"gh\" Sound", "level": 6, "prov": [{"page_no": 13}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/282", "label": "section_header", "text": "Read aloud.", "level": 6, "prov": [{"page_no": 13}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/283", "label": "text", "text": "Look at the photos on the phone.", "level": null, "prov": [{"page_no": 13}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/284", "label": "text", "text": "Here are a few of my favourite ones:", "level": null, "prov": [{"page_no": 13}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/285", "label": "text", "text": "Philip is fixing the music box;", "level": null, "prov": [{"page_no": 13}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/286", "label": "text", "text": "Sophia is making paper cuts;", "level": null, "prov": [{"page_no": 13}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/287", "label": "text", "text": "Fiona is drawing butterflies;", "level": null, "prov": [{"page_no": 13}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/288", "label": "text", "text": "All of us are laughing and having fun.", "level": null, "prov": [{"page_no": 13}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/291", "label": "text", "text": "Listen to the rest of the poem. Write down the special points of Shirley, Claire and Trevor.", "level": null, "prov": [{"page_no": 13}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/292", "label": "section_header", "text": "上海教育出版社", "level": 6, "prov": [{"page_no": 13}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/293", "label": "page_footer", "text": "5", "level": null, "prov": [{"page_no": 13}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/294", "label": "page_header", "text": "B", "level": null, "prov": [{"page_no": 14}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/295", "label": "page_header", "text": "Finding differences", "level": null, "prov": [{"page_no": 14}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/298", "label": "text", "text": "New Star and Swan Lake will have a student talent show together. Paul gives a list of shows. Lu Yao is preparing for the programme. Wang Yiming offers to help her.", "level": null, "prov": [{"page_no": 14}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/1009", "label": "section_header", "text": "Conversation B", "level": 6, "prov": [{"page_no": 46}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/1019", "label": "text", "text": "watch be celebrate play learn eat", "level": null, "prov": [{"page_no": 46}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/1020", "label": "page_footer", "text": "38", "level": null, "prov": [{"page_no": 46}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/1021", "label": "page_footer", "text": "上海教育出版社", "level": null, "prov": [{"page_no": 46}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/1022", "label": "section_header", "text": "上海教育出版社", "level": 6, "prov": [{"page_no": 47}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/1027", "label": "section_header", "text": "4 \u0007Pair and share Work in pairs. Talk about your experiences during the last Spring Festival.", "level": 6, "prov": [{"page_no": 47}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/1029", "label": "text", "text": "Where did you spend the Spring Festival last year?", "level": null, "prov": [{"page_no": 47}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/1030", "label": "text", "text": "Whom did you spend the festival with?", "level": null, "prov": [{"page_no": 47}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/1031", "label": "text", "text": "What did you do at the festival?", "level": null, "prov": [{"page_no": 47}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/1032", "label": "text", "text": "Which experience was the most unforgettable? Why?", "level": null, "prov": [{"page_no": 47}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/1033", "label": "text", "text": "...", "level": null, "prov": [{"page_no": 47}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/1035", "label": "text", "text": "e.g. Both of us spent the last Spring Festival at home.", "level": null, "prov": [{"page_no": 47}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/1036", "label": "section_header", "text": "上海教育出版社", "level": 6, "prov": [{"page_no": 47}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/1038", "label": "page_footer", "text": "39", "level": null, "prov": [{"page_no": 47}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/1043", "label": "section_header", "text": "You want to post your festival experience on a website about teenage life.", "level": 6, "prov": [{"page_no": 48}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/1045", "label": "text", "text": "←→", "level": null, "prov": [{"page_no": 48}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/1046", "label": "text", "text": "￥", "level": null, "prov": [{"page_no": 48}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/1047", "label": "text", "text": "Last week, we celebrated the new year! On New Year's Eve, we had a big meal.", "level": null, "prov": [{"page_no": 48}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/1048", "label": "text", "text": "The beans were my favorite. In America, we eat beans because we believe that beans will bring us a year's good luck! After the meal, we watched a light show and counted down the seconds in Times Square! We were very excited!", "level": null, "prov": [{"page_no": 48}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/1049", "label": "text", "text": "Ada, the United States (posted at 9:30 p.m., 8 Jan.)", "level": null, "prov": [{"page_no": 48}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/1065", "label": "section_header", "text": "Using capital letters for proper nouns TEEN skill", "level": 6, "prov": [{"page_no": 48}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/1066", "label": "text", "text": "A proper noun is the name of a person, place, organization or thing. Proper nouns usually begin with a capital letter. For example, \"China\", \"People's Square\" and \"Ada\" are proper nouns.", "level": null, "prov": [{"page_no": 48}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/1068", "label": "page_footer", "text": "40", "level": null, "prov": [{"page_no": 48}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/1069", "label": "page_header", "text": "3", "level": null, "prov": [{"page_no": 49}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/1070", "label": "section_header", "text": "上海教育出版社", "level": 6, "prov": [{"page_no": 49}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/2175", "label": "section_header", "text": "Zheng He (1371-1433 or 1375-1435)", "level": 6, "prov": [{"page_no": 95}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/2176", "label": "text", "text": "was a Chinese explorer. He travelled out of China seven times to explore the world. He visited Southeast Asia, the Middle East and even the east coast of Africa. He helped build trade relations with many countries.", "level": null, "prov": [{"page_no": 95}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/2177", "label": "section_header", "text": "Wang Zhenyi (1768-1797) was a", "level": 6, "prov": [{"page_no": 95}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/2178", "label": "text", "text": "Chinese scientist. She wrote papers on the stars and used a simple language to explain maths. In 1994, a crater ③ on Venus ④ was named after her to mark her contributions to astronomy.", "level": null, "prov": [{"page_no": 95}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/2180", "label": "text", "text": "Search for more information about one of the people above.", "level": null, "prov": [{"page_no": 95}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/2183", "label": "page_footer", "text": "87", "level": null, "prov": [{"page_no": 95}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/2186", "label": "section_header", "text": "Bridging cultures", "level": 6, "prov": [{"page_no": 96}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/2187", "label": "text", "text": "Wang Yiming and Lin Dong are theatre lovers. They are looking at a flyer about a \"Shakespeare Meets Tang Xianzu\" series ① of activities. Help them choose one activity to attend and get to know more about the two writers and their dramas.", "level": null, "prov": [{"page_no": 96}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/2188", "label": "section_header", "text": "Shakespeare Meets Tang Xianzu", "level": 6, "prov": [{"page_no": 96}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/2189", "label": "text", "text": "Shakespeare and Tang Xianzu wrote plays in the same era. How much do you know about them? Have you read their plays? If the two writers met, what would they say to each other? Welcome to our activities and get to know more about these two famous writers!", "level": null, "prov": [{"page_no": 96}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/2191", "label": "text", "text": "Performing dramas Reading dramas Sharing stories", "level": null, "prov": [{"page_no": 96}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/2192", "label": "text", "text": "SIPE", "level": null, "prov": [{"page_no": 96}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/2193", "label": "text", "text": "Discuss the questions in the flyer above and search for stories about more writers in China or the UK.", "level": null, "prov": [{"page_no": 96}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/2194", "label": "section_header", "text": "Word bank", "level": 6, "prov": [{"page_no": 96}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/2195", "label": "text", "text": "Confucius 孔子 philosophy 哲学 moral outlook 道德观 saying 格言", "level": null, "prov": [{"page_no": 96}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/2196", "label": "footnote", "text": "① series 系列", "level": null, "prov": [{"page_no": 96}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/2197", "label": "text", "text": "Southeast Asia 东南亚 the Middle East 中东 contribution 贡献", "level": null, "prov": [{"page_no": 96}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/2198", "label": "section_header", "text": "上海教育出版社", "level": 6, "prov": [{"page_no": 96}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/2199", "label": "page_footer", "text": "88", "level": null, "prov": [{"page_no": 96}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/2200", "label": "page_footer", "text": "上海教育出版社", "level": null, "prov": [{"page_no": 96}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/2201", "label": "page_header", "text": "Culture corner", "level": null, "prov": [{"page_no": 97}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/2202", "label": "section_header", "text": "上海教育出版社", "level": 6, "prov": [{"page_no": 97}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/2203", "label": "section_header", "text": "Exploring the world: Antarctica", "level": 6, "prov": [{"page_no": 97}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/2204", "label": "section_header", "text": "First impressions", "level": 6, "prov": [{"page_no": 97}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/2205", "label": "text", "text": "Antarctica is the driest, coldest and windiest continent on the Earth. About 98% of the land is under snow and ice, but Antarctica is the largest desert in the world. The lowest temperature there was -89.2°C and the wind usually blows at a speed of 17-18 metres per second.", "level": null, "prov": [{"page_no": 97}]}], "tables": [], "pictures": [], "body": {"children": [{"$ref": "#/pictures/0"}, {"$ref": "#/texts/2"}, {"$ref": "#/texts/3"}, {"$ref": "#/texts/4"}, {"$ref": "#/texts/5"}, {"$ref": "#/texts/6"}, {